name=Vitals HUD
id=Vitals_HUD
author=kramari
description=Vitals HUD adds a compact and customizable survivor status display for Project Zomboid Build 42. It shows health, endurance, fatigue, hunger and thirst at a glance, while additional conditions appear automatically only when active. Core body temperature is displayed using a cold / normal / hot gauge. The HUD can be moved and resized, supports bar or numeric displays, and remembers its position and settings. Optional hidden-information settings can reveal exact temperature, zombie infection status and calories, but are disabled by default. The mod is display-only and does not modify character stats or gameplay mechanics.
modversion=0.5
versionMin=42.0